WEBVTT

01:38.229 --> 01:41.070
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.110 --> 01:44.030
[Episode 34]

02:10.030 --> 02:11.680
Jiu, it's time.

02:16.829 --> 02:17.360
Let's go.

02:32.520 --> 02:33.050
Let's go.

02:39.310 --> 02:40.440
Why make such a fuss?

02:41.590 --> 02:42.450
Our Master said

02:42.840 --> 02:44.370
tonight is your big moment.

02:44.660 --> 02:46.260
There can't be any slip-ups.

02:47.680 --> 02:48.450
Uncle

02:48.750 --> 02:50.210
is really attentive to me.

02:50.910 --> 02:51.910
This way, please.

03:10.960 --> 03:12.150
It's even quieter

03:12.960 --> 03:13.820
than last time.

03:14.710 --> 03:16.310
All the shops are closed too.

03:16.710 --> 03:18.520
Besides the waterways, they've also

03:18.520 --> 03:20.120
locked down the entire city.

03:20.430 --> 03:21.120
Seems like

03:21.910 --> 03:23.510
your guess might be correct.

03:25.840 --> 03:26.970
Humans are cunning.

03:27.590 --> 03:28.920
No matter what happens,

03:29.240 --> 03:30.770
it's always right to assume

03:31.079 --> 03:31.680
the worst.

03:32.190 --> 03:34.190
Let's head for the Sky Cavern first.

03:34.280 --> 03:34.720
Okay.

03:35.400 --> 03:36.300
Let's go this way.

03:36.300 --> 03:37.900
Be careful not to alert them.

03:38.520 --> 03:39.010
Okay.

04:04.250 --> 04:06.050
Jiu, here we are.

04:10.840 --> 04:11.570
Manager Lyu.

04:12.680 --> 04:13.940
There's a situation outside.

04:13.940 --> 04:14.600
Our men don't know

04:14.600 --> 04:15.530
how to handle it.

04:22.700 --> 04:23.500
What's wrong?

04:23.760 --> 04:24.430
Nothing serious.

04:24.430 --> 04:25.250
I'll go fix it.

04:25.600 --> 04:27.110
Jiu, please go ahead.

04:27.160 --> 04:28.220
I'll be there soon.

04:29.020 --> 04:29.430
Okay.

04:41.250 --> 04:42.650
This is heavily guarded.

04:42.830 --> 04:43.960
I'll go in and check.

04:45.390 --> 04:46.390
Do you have a plan?

04:48.240 --> 04:49.440
Just fight our way in.

04:49.870 --> 04:50.930
Don't be reckless.

04:51.040 --> 04:52.300
They far outnumber us.

04:52.360 --> 04:54.760
Do those weaklings even count as manpower?

04:55.510 --> 04:56.510
Don't forget that

04:57.100 --> 04:57.920
all your injuries

04:57.920 --> 04:59.850
were caused by those "weaklings."

05:00.280 --> 05:01.500
Quiet! Look.

05:08.640 --> 05:10.440
Can't hear what they're saying.

05:12.720 --> 05:13.870
There's a boat out there.

05:13.870 --> 05:14.750
It surely carried someone.

05:14.750 --> 05:15.870
"There's a boat out there.

05:15.870 --> 05:17.470
It surely carried someone."

05:17.680 --> 05:18.680
No matter who it is,

05:18.680 --> 05:19.360
we can't let them mess up

05:19.360 --> 05:20.830
the things at the Bone Washing Pool.

05:20.830 --> 05:21.630
"We can't let them

05:21.630 --> 05:24.080
mess up the things at the Bone Washing Pool."

05:24.080 --> 05:25.880
"Kill any intruders you find."

05:26.160 --> 05:27.120
-Yes.
-Yes.

05:31.950 --> 05:33.240
The Bone Washing Pool?

05:33.560 --> 05:35.220
Did they already get started?

05:36.510 --> 05:38.390
I know that path. Follow me.

05:59.170 --> 06:00.720
The Bone Washing Pool is over there.

06:00.720 --> 06:02.650
I'll hold them off. You keep going.

06:08.240 --> 06:08.800
Keep up.

06:09.800 --> 06:10.040
Go.

07:34.000 --> 07:34.480
Xuanye.

07:38.190 --> 07:38.990
Uncle, is this

07:39.310 --> 07:41.720
the Bone Washing Pool that you mentioned?

07:42.360 --> 07:43.159
That's right.

07:45.000 --> 07:45.730
This is where

07:47.680 --> 07:48.310
you're going to

07:48.310 --> 07:49.560
get a rebirth.

07:51.000 --> 07:53.190
It's also the Gate connecting the two realms.

07:53.190 --> 07:54.520
The 12th year is coming.

07:55.120 --> 07:55.580
Xuanye,

07:56.720 --> 07:58.280
Beyond this is your home,

07:59.120 --> 08:00.180
the Carefree Land.

08:01.040 --> 08:01.840
You know what?

08:02.800 --> 08:04.870
I once accidentally entered that place

08:04.870 --> 08:07.360
and saw one of the most unforgettable scenes in my life.

08:07.360 --> 08:09.020
Demons and monsters abounded

08:09.120 --> 08:10.560
and ran rampant;

08:11.120 --> 08:13.480
each one was unbelievably strong and mighty.

08:13.480 --> 08:14.880
Even if only one in 10,000

08:15.360 --> 08:16.720
of such formidable demons come

08:16.720 --> 08:17.850
to the mortal world,

08:17.890 --> 08:18.750
it'll bring

08:18.770 --> 08:20.770
catastrophic disaster to mankind.

08:21.950 --> 08:22.810
But they can't.

08:24.160 --> 08:26.020
I am from the Mystic Panther clan.

08:26.120 --> 08:27.390
Our mission

08:27.430 --> 08:28.890
is to guard this Realm Gate

08:29.240 --> 08:30.880
and prevent the Carefree Land's demons

08:30.880 --> 08:32.610
from coming to the human world.

08:32.669 --> 08:33.320
Is that so?

08:35.030 --> 08:36.030
But you came here.

08:37.080 --> 08:38.210
So did your brother.

08:39.080 --> 08:40.830
How can you guarantee they won't come?

08:40.830 --> 08:42.030
And how can you ensure that the Mystic Panthers

08:42.030 --> 08:42.840
will never change

08:42.840 --> 08:43.960
and will always be able to fight off

08:43.960 --> 08:45.020
other demon clans?

08:46.670 --> 08:47.460
So,

08:47.980 --> 08:50.380
Uncle, you established the Sky Cavern here

08:50.410 --> 08:51.480
not for money,

08:52.300 --> 08:53.830
but to guard the Realm Gate?

08:54.030 --> 08:54.630
Of course.

08:55.910 --> 08:57.310
The Sky Cavern's mission

08:57.390 --> 08:58.840
is to fend off the demon clans

08:58.840 --> 09:00.240
and guard the Realm Gate.

09:01.670 --> 09:03.350
If things go south one day,

09:03.910 --> 09:05.370
we will fight to the death.

09:07.310 --> 09:08.300
Even if we have to blow up

09:08.300 --> 09:09.780
the entire Underground City,

09:09.780 --> 09:10.790
we must not allow demon clans

09:10.790 --> 09:12.450
to set foot in the human world.

09:14.390 --> 09:15.120
I guessed so.

09:16.510 --> 09:17.000
What?

09:18.600 --> 09:20.670
If it weren't to fight the demon clans,

09:20.670 --> 09:22.430
why would you have carved

09:22.720 --> 09:25.850
the demon-subduing formations all over the stone wall?

09:28.270 --> 09:28.790
Xuanye,

09:30.150 --> 09:31.240
you know, we humans

09:31.270 --> 09:32.600
have a saying that goes,

09:32.870 --> 09:35.330
"Those not of our kind can never be trusted."

09:36.550 --> 09:37.320
Not all demons

09:37.320 --> 09:38.240
are like you.

09:40.600 --> 09:41.850
Everything I've done

09:42.790 --> 09:44.190
is just for our survival.

09:45.550 --> 09:47.080
Hope the demons won't come,

09:47.910 --> 09:49.320
never come.

09:52.320 --> 09:52.910
Uncle,

09:54.290 --> 09:55.290
when did you

09:55.320 --> 09:56.520
discover this place?

09:58.240 --> 09:59.360
I told you

10:01.240 --> 10:03.140
I once fell for a fox demon.

10:04.150 --> 10:05.240
Later, she accidentally

10:05.240 --> 10:05.910
hurt me,

10:06.270 --> 10:07.600
so she left out of guilt.

10:08.480 --> 10:09.150
Since then,

10:09.600 --> 10:10.800
I've been looking for

10:10.870 --> 10:12.670
a way to turn demons into humans.

10:13.690 --> 10:14.530
Now,

10:15.320 --> 10:16.380
I've worked it out,

10:17.420 --> 10:19.020
but I can't find her anymore.

10:23.080 --> 10:24.680
Have others tried it before?

10:24.910 --> 10:25.570
Yeah, sure.

10:26.270 --> 10:28.600
Otherwise, how could I dare to let you try?

10:31.200 --> 10:32.000
Are you ready?

10:39.600 --> 10:40.350
Xuanye.

10:41.990 --> 10:43.450
Humans are born ignorant,

10:44.750 --> 10:46.810
leading a sordid life of petty gains,

10:47.030 --> 10:50.750
even unable to scratch the surface of what the world is really about.

10:50.750 --> 10:52.440
They're naturally intimidated

10:52.440 --> 10:53.690
by the unknown.

10:55.030 --> 10:55.830
You know what?

10:57.150 --> 10:59.150
Throughout history, those who made

10:59.270 --> 11:01.360
great achievements weren't necessarily the smartest,

11:01.360 --> 11:03.690
but definitely the bravest of their time.

11:04.200 --> 11:04.750
Look.

11:07.230 --> 11:08.560
The Path of Life is open.

11:10.440 --> 11:12.300
Whether you want to live as a human

11:12.870 --> 11:14.030
or remain a demon,

11:15.440 --> 11:16.000
it's now

11:17.320 --> 11:19.000
your call.

11:21.030 --> 11:21.510
Please.

11:28.910 --> 11:29.510
Get them!

11:30.410 --> 11:31.030
Come on!

11:37.670 --> 11:38.200
That way!

11:38.670 --> 11:39.330
Stop there!

11:57.790 --> 11:58.650
-Let's go.
-Go.

11:58.750 --> 12:00.410
You're impressive fighters.

12:04.150 --> 12:04.810
Miss Duan,

12:05.360 --> 12:06.420
here we meet again.

12:07.550 --> 12:08.480
Where's Xuanye?

12:09.480 --> 12:11.140
Jiu's deeply in love with you,

12:11.350 --> 12:13.380
yet you're hanging out with the demon who hurt him.

12:13.380 --> 12:15.640
Aren't you afraid of breaking his heart?

12:16.390 --> 12:18.390
You are the ones who want to hurt him!

12:18.640 --> 12:20.670
We've helped you guys over and over again,

12:20.670 --> 12:22.330
but you blindly trust a demon.

12:23.550 --> 12:25.030
It's truly disheartening.

12:25.030 --> 12:26.630
Cut the crap, dude.

12:27.240 --> 12:28.840
We've already sent a message.

12:28.840 --> 12:29.960
If we die here,

12:30.270 --> 12:30.970
I swear

12:31.480 --> 12:33.000
not a single living being

12:33.550 --> 12:35.350
will survive in your Sky Cavern.

12:36.120 --> 12:36.790
Catch them.

12:37.200 --> 12:38.200
-Yes!
-Let's go!

12:42.390 --> 12:44.720
No time to waste! I'm going to find Xuanye!

13:11.950 --> 13:13.360
Not bad, Commissioner.

13:13.920 --> 13:14.980
I am your superior.

13:15.150 --> 13:16.480
If I couldn't outdo you,

13:16.670 --> 13:18.330
how could I deserve my salary?

13:18.670 --> 13:19.530
Oh, arrogance.

13:47.510 --> 13:48.310
What's wrong?

13:48.960 --> 13:50.020
Are you afraid now?

13:53.960 --> 13:55.160
Uncle, you're right.

13:56.200 --> 13:57.260
I am indeed afraid.

13:58.500 --> 13:59.280
I am not the bravest

13:59.280 --> 14:00.640
of our time.

14:03.120 --> 14:05.250
Sorry for having troubled you, Uncle.

14:05.510 --> 14:06.750
I need to ponder over

14:07.510 --> 14:08.850
where my future path

14:09.030 --> 14:09.920
should lead.

14:12.030 --> 14:13.290
I'll take my leave now.

14:14.510 --> 14:15.170
Stop there.

14:22.080 --> 14:23.410
When did you find it out?

14:24.030 --> 14:25.160
You were rushing it.

14:25.550 --> 14:27.150
I haven't known you and Lyu

14:27.600 --> 14:28.840
for very long.

14:29.550 --> 14:31.010
Usually, you all maintain

14:31.360 --> 14:32.430
a calm demeanor

14:32.600 --> 14:33.630
come what may.

14:34.350 --> 14:36.240
But you showed unusual concern only for

14:36.240 --> 14:37.840
my demon-human transformation

14:37.840 --> 14:39.240
in the Underground City.

14:39.490 --> 14:40.120
I found it

14:40.150 --> 14:41.210
a bit off back then.

14:41.840 --> 14:42.360
Maybe it was just

14:42.360 --> 14:44.290
out of our genuine concern for you.

14:45.620 --> 14:46.120
That's

14:46.150 --> 14:48.010
what I thought in the first place.

14:48.270 --> 14:48.870
But soon,

14:49.860 --> 14:50.320
I once again

14:50.320 --> 14:52.380
lost consciousness and transformed

14:52.510 --> 14:53.370
into a panther.

14:54.790 --> 14:57.320
Could it be related to the Peerless Bracelet?

14:58.600 --> 14:59.030
Yes,

14:59.810 --> 15:00.320
I thought

15:00.320 --> 15:01.650
the same the first time.

15:02.200 --> 15:03.330
But the second time,

15:03.550 --> 15:04.750
I was pretty sure that

15:05.440 --> 15:07.490
someone was deliberately causing this.

15:07.490 --> 15:09.320
Zi Kong was the only one who managed to

15:09.320 --> 15:10.180
make it before.

15:10.730 --> 15:11.860
So I went to find him.

15:14.750 --> 15:15.680
Did you find him?

15:17.080 --> 15:17.810
No, I didn't.

15:18.810 --> 15:19.510
But I discovered

15:19.510 --> 15:20.840
where you ambushed him.

15:22.150 --> 15:23.790
The Eight Pillar Sect's Dragon-locking Formation

15:23.790 --> 15:25.880
and the Underground City's pass token,

15:25.880 --> 15:27.070
I do recognize them.

15:31.240 --> 15:31.840
If Zi Kong

15:31.840 --> 15:33.500
really got caught by you guys,

15:34.320 --> 15:35.040
then who was the one

15:35.040 --> 15:36.240
plotting against me?

15:39.120 --> 15:39.630
Uncle,

15:40.520 --> 15:41.480
I really can't figure out

15:41.480 --> 15:42.510
what you are up to.

15:43.790 --> 15:45.170
If you think I'm a demon,

15:45.550 --> 15:47.350
you can just go ahead and kill me.

15:47.500 --> 15:49.300
Why bother going to such lengths

15:49.380 --> 15:50.150
to put on this show

15:50.150 --> 15:51.480
of being a caring uncle?

15:56.480 --> 15:57.740
Out of curiosity about

15:58.120 --> 15:59.780
your views on the demon clans,

16:00.770 --> 16:01.600
I went to

16:01.630 --> 16:02.720
the 18 Stores

16:03.220 --> 16:05.180
and checked the records of Song Qi's

16:05.180 --> 16:07.580
entries and exits in the Underground City.

16:16.120 --> 16:17.240
He has never left

16:17.240 --> 16:18.500
the Underground City.

16:18.790 --> 16:20.650
But you told me in your letter that

16:21.080 --> 16:22.740
he had already been sent away.

16:23.030 --> 16:23.720
So,

16:24.550 --> 16:25.080
Uncle,

16:26.120 --> 16:26.980
you were lying.

16:28.030 --> 16:30.230
Our Sky Cavern is wealthy and powerful.

16:30.630 --> 16:31.790
Perhaps we used some means

16:31.790 --> 16:33.390
to send him away in secret.

16:34.320 --> 16:34.720
No,

16:35.550 --> 16:36.410
you killed him.

16:37.960 --> 16:38.960
Over these years,

16:39.150 --> 16:41.790
the Sky Cavern's been buying demons at high prices.

16:41.790 --> 16:43.480
Many demon hunter friends of mine

16:43.480 --> 16:44.810
are all your customers.

16:45.240 --> 16:47.670
Even Jiang Shangyun and his disciple

16:47.970 --> 16:49.250
were your honored guests.

16:48.730 --> 16:49.360
[Jiang Shangyun]

16:50.750 --> 16:51.720
The two of them

16:52.320 --> 16:54.050
were also killed by you, right?

16:57.150 --> 16:59.080
You've collected loads of demons.

16:59.270 --> 17:00.930
Where are you hiding them all?

17:01.840 --> 17:03.010
If I'm not mistaken,

17:04.119 --> 17:04.920
you've thrown them all

17:04.920 --> 17:06.849
into the Bone Washing Pool, right?

17:09.109 --> 17:10.569
You used Banxia to lure me,

17:11.310 --> 17:13.970
orchestrating a plan to drive me out of control,

17:14.000 --> 17:14.680
just to make me

17:14.680 --> 17:16.410
jump into the Bone Washing Pool

17:16.640 --> 17:17.900
and get my demon bones.

17:18.510 --> 17:20.010
You do have the guts then.

17:21.030 --> 17:23.000
You knew I was up to something, yet you

17:23.000 --> 17:24.130
still dared to come?

17:24.829 --> 17:26.170
I had to figure out

17:26.270 --> 17:27.930
what tricks you were playing.

17:28.240 --> 17:29.830
Otherwise, I'd be a pain to live

17:29.830 --> 17:31.350
on guard against you every day.

17:31.350 --> 17:32.610
Aren't you afraid that

17:33.110 --> 17:35.030
you might not be able to leave once you're here?

17:35.030 --> 17:36.360
Are you going to kill me?

17:36.830 --> 17:38.630
I've never offended you, have I?

17:38.880 --> 17:40.080
If you want to kill me,

17:40.790 --> 17:42.920
you've had so many chances to do it before.

17:42.920 --> 17:44.920
Why did you have to wait until today?

17:48.590 --> 17:49.850
This Bone Washing Pool

17:49.900 --> 17:50.880
can't help me transform

17:50.880 --> 17:52.640
from a demon into a human, I guess.

17:52.640 --> 17:54.100
You want me to jump into it.

17:56.000 --> 17:57.400
What exactly do you want?

17:58.510 --> 17:59.770
My primordial spirit?

18:00.350 --> 18:01.560
Or my physical body?

18:03.160 --> 18:04.120
Your Sky Cavern

18:04.440 --> 18:06.920
has been running in the Underground City for years.

18:06.920 --> 18:08.650
You must have great ambitions.

18:10.110 --> 18:10.800
Are you

18:12.110 --> 18:14.110
plotting against the Carefree Land, Uncle?

18:14.110 --> 18:15.110
Enough!

18:18.350 --> 18:18.880
Alright.

18:20.610 --> 18:21.680
Since you've already guessed it,

18:21.680 --> 18:23.280
I won't beat around the bush.

18:24.720 --> 18:26.120
Given our relationship,

18:27.230 --> 18:29.290
as long as you jump into it on your own,

18:30.180 --> 18:31.490
perhaps our Eight Pillar Sect

18:31.490 --> 18:33.690
can still maintain some final dignity.

18:34.000 --> 18:34.510
Jump!

18:35.720 --> 18:36.240
Uncle,

18:37.000 --> 18:38.130
stop joking around.

18:39.160 --> 18:40.220
You want to kill me,

18:40.450 --> 18:41.110
so there's already no dignity left

18:41.110 --> 18:42.310
between the two of us!

18:45.440 --> 18:46.700
Maybe it's not too late

18:47.440 --> 18:49.300
to change your mind and stop here.

18:49.480 --> 18:50.310
It's too late.

18:52.310 --> 18:53.640
It's already been too late

18:53.640 --> 18:54.700
since 12 years ago.

18:58.160 --> 18:59.400
So cut the crap!

19:13.830 --> 19:15.090
The Greedy Wolf Sword?

19:19.430 --> 19:20.690
My stubborn old master

19:21.170 --> 19:22.480
refused to pass down the Hidden Dragon Case

19:22.480 --> 19:23.000
to me.

19:23.750 --> 19:24.550
Instead, he insisted on

19:24.550 --> 19:26.070
giving it to your unambitious father,

19:26.070 --> 19:27.160
letting such a treasure end up

19:27.160 --> 19:28.820
being held by a demon like you!

19:28.960 --> 19:30.240
How ridiculous.

19:31.160 --> 19:33.070
The Eight Pillar Sect values harmony with all beings

19:33.070 --> 19:34.400
and going with the flow.

19:34.590 --> 19:35.880
A radical man like you

19:36.310 --> 19:37.840
could never understand it.

19:39.090 --> 19:40.760
Let me go! Let go!

19:42.110 --> 19:42.720
Banxia!

19:44.270 --> 19:44.790
Xuanye!

19:45.550 --> 19:46.750
The Bone Washing Pool can't help you

19:46.750 --> 19:47.710
transform into a human.

19:47.710 --> 19:48.880
Instead, it will kill you!

19:48.880 --> 19:49.940
Get out of here now!

19:50.590 --> 19:51.190
Let her go!

19:51.400 --> 19:53.000
She has nothing to do with this!

19:53.000 --> 19:55.060
She does have nothing to do with this.

19:55.170 --> 19:56.000
So, Xuanye,

19:56.960 --> 19:58.240
as long as you jump into

19:58.270 --> 19:59.440
the pool on your own,

19:59.580 --> 20:00.480
I'll let her go.

20:01.350 --> 20:02.410
I'm a man of my word.

20:05.080 --> 20:06.710
Xuanye, don't listen to his nonsense!

20:06.710 --> 20:07.270
Shut up!

20:09.500 --> 20:10.160
Xuanye,

20:10.800 --> 20:11.350
her survival

20:11.350 --> 20:13.010
is actually not decided by me.

20:13.500 --> 20:14.780
It all depends on you.

20:16.550 --> 20:17.400
You know I'm not

20:17.400 --> 20:18.480
a patient person.

20:30.320 --> 20:31.120
Push her down.

21:03.200 --> 21:04.460
Good, you're here too!

21:05.880 --> 21:08.140
Now you two brothers have gathered here.

21:09.110 --> 21:10.000
Kill them!

21:10.350 --> 21:11.080
Yes, Master!

21:15.360 --> 21:16.690
Let's end this quickly.

21:17.030 --> 21:18.760
That's also what I'm thinking.

23:01.720 --> 23:02.250
Man Ying!

23:14.640 --> 23:16.230
Do you still remember the skills

23:16.230 --> 23:17.290
Father taught you?

23:17.960 --> 23:18.550
Yes.

23:19.550 --> 23:19.960
Good.

23:20.750 --> 23:21.590
Then show me

23:22.310 --> 23:23.970
how much progress you've made

23:24.000 --> 23:26.260
after all these years in the human world.

23:29.500 --> 23:30.680
Interesting.

25:33.400 --> 25:34.160
Watch out!

25:49.960 --> 25:51.770
I'll break this formation with Shao Li Lance.

25:51.770 --> 25:52.900
If there's a chance,

25:53.000 --> 25:54.060
take it and escape.

25:55.560 --> 25:56.480
Once the formation is bust,

25:56.480 --> 25:58.140
we'll both fall into the pool.

25:58.830 --> 25:59.560
I have a plan.

25:59.960 --> 26:00.880
Just do as I say.

26:01.750 --> 26:02.270
But...

26:02.550 --> 26:03.280
Don't argue.

26:03.640 --> 26:04.970
I'm your older brother.

26:05.240 --> 26:06.570
You should listen to me.

26:33.920 --> 26:34.750
Lingying.

27:07.640 --> 27:08.970
I'll kill you!

27:36.750 --> 27:37.350
Youhuang.

27:38.480 --> 27:39.080
Youhuang.

27:42.480 --> 27:46.130
Commissioner, I'm fine.

27:49.640 --> 27:50.240
Youhuang.

27:53.240 --> 27:53.970
Youhuang...

27:59.300 --> 28:00.030
Youhuang?

28:49.270 --> 28:51.070
I truly underestimated you two.

28:51.520 --> 28:52.470
However, this show

28:52.470 --> 28:53.870
should come to an end now.

29:13.110 --> 29:13.720
Man Ying,

29:14.880 --> 29:17.520
I'm entrusting the Mystic Panther Clan and the Carefree Land

29:17.520 --> 29:18.940
to you now.

29:29.310 --> 29:30.480
You were too slow!

29:30.510 --> 29:31.720
I was letting you win.

29:32.200 --> 29:34.310
Funny. Then let's do it again!

29:34.350 --> 29:35.550
I'd rather rest a bit.

29:35.640 --> 29:36.700
Let's take a break.

29:38.400 --> 29:38.960
Zi Kong,

29:39.590 --> 29:41.480
what do you want to do when you grow up?

29:41.480 --> 29:42.410
Like our father,

29:42.640 --> 29:44.100
I want to be the clan leader

29:44.270 --> 29:45.680
to protect the Carefree Land and Mystic Panthers.

29:45.680 --> 29:46.540
What about you?

29:46.680 --> 29:47.240
Me?

29:47.920 --> 29:48.480
I want to

29:48.510 --> 29:49.830
be your support.

29:50.940 --> 29:52.190
If you really become the leader

29:52.190 --> 29:54.150
of the Mystic Panther Clan in the future,

29:54.150 --> 29:54.790
remember that

29:54.790 --> 29:56.030
I'm also one of them,

29:56.240 --> 29:57.750
and you should protect me too.

29:57.750 --> 29:58.400
Of course.

29:59.590 --> 30:00.450
No matter when,

30:00.920 --> 30:02.380
I will always protect you.

30:56.480 --> 30:57.470
Congratulations, Master,

30:57.470 --> 30:59.840
on collecting 1,000 demons' bones!

31:24.190 --> 31:26.050
You've transformed into a demon?

31:29.750 --> 31:31.400
Ridiculous, huh?

31:32.590 --> 31:34.550
I've actually turned into a demon,

31:35.790 --> 31:38.750
what I hated the most!

31:40.240 --> 31:41.760
I've become a demon.

31:44.200 --> 31:45.230
Miss Duan,

31:47.350 --> 31:49.240
I know you don't recognize me,

31:51.000 --> 31:52.480
but do you remember

31:52.880 --> 31:54.970
the human trafficker who sold you?

31:58.540 --> 31:59.740
So beautiful.

31:59.880 --> 32:00.680
I know, right?

32:03.160 --> 32:04.920
It's pretty. I think...

32:05.480 --> 32:06.800
This one is nice too.

32:12.680 --> 32:14.410
I have some candy here. Come on.

32:15.580 --> 32:17.900
That day in the filthiest, narrowest alley

32:17.900 --> 32:20.220
of the Underground City,

32:20.960 --> 32:22.110
I killed that demon,

32:22.400 --> 32:24.070
avenging my entire family.

32:25.000 --> 32:27.300
Fate does work in mysterious ways.

32:27.880 --> 32:29.280
It was also on that day

32:30.120 --> 32:31.740
that I met you.

32:34.580 --> 32:36.000
You have nowhere to escape now.

32:36.000 --> 32:36.860
Go back with me!

32:37.590 --> 32:38.680
Let go of me!

32:42.440 --> 32:43.770
You little brat, you...

33:01.350 --> 33:02.920
I should say thank you.

33:03.640 --> 33:04.510
You were the one

33:05.440 --> 33:07.570
who brought me into the Carefree Land.

33:09.000 --> 33:10.000
There,

33:10.510 --> 33:12.640
I saw the origin of all demons,

33:13.880 --> 33:15.910
the Carefree Herb.

33:17.310 --> 33:19.910
That place was awash with primordial spirits.

33:20.530 --> 33:21.680
I finally realized

33:21.710 --> 33:23.470
why more demons would appear

33:23.510 --> 33:25.350
every 12 years,

33:25.920 --> 33:29.590
like a never-ending cycle with demons emerging infinitely.

33:31.790 --> 33:32.880
I supposed that

33:33.400 --> 33:35.480
if I could destroy the Carefree Herb,

33:36.200 --> 33:38.310
there would be no more primordial spirits in this world,

33:38.310 --> 33:40.480
and thus, no more demons as well.

33:47.240 --> 33:49.350
But I hated myself

33:50.720 --> 33:52.310
because I was human!

33:52.640 --> 33:54.160
Humans can do nothing

33:54.350 --> 33:55.840
in the Carefree Land!

33:57.200 --> 33:58.590
I needed to find a way

33:59.510 --> 34:01.550
to turn myself into a demon.

34:02.070 --> 34:04.470
Only then can I sneak into the Carefree Land

34:04.480 --> 34:06.860
and eliminate all the demons!

34:07.370 --> 34:09.570
Is this the solution you've come up with

34:09.630 --> 34:10.880
as a demon hunter?

34:11.440 --> 34:12.239
That's right.

34:13.679 --> 34:15.070
To get rid of demons,

34:16.360 --> 34:18.630
I must become a demon first!

34:18.710 --> 34:19.590
Dream on!

34:31.750 --> 34:33.460
You're right. It is a dream.

34:34.280 --> 34:34.880
But my dream

34:34.880 --> 34:35.960
is about to come true,

34:35.960 --> 34:37.000
while your dream

34:39.000 --> 34:40.330
will never be realized.

34:50.219 --> 34:50.880
Xuanye!

35:29.650 --> 35:31.860
The Realm Gate is about to open.

35:33.030 --> 35:36.030
Behold the doomsday for the demon clans!

35:55.360 --> 35:56.760
Wait for another 12 years

35:56.920 --> 35:58.840
if you want to enter the Carefree Land!

35:58.840 --> 36:00.030
Seriously?

36:01.440 --> 36:03.400
No one can stop me!

36:21.320 --> 36:22.360
Open!

36:22.720 --> 36:25.460
Now!

36:36.550 --> 36:37.710
Fine.

36:38.960 --> 36:41.290
Since you are stopping me from opening it,

36:41.320 --> 36:43.680
I'll reduce the entire Underground City

36:43.700 --> 36:45.340
and the whole Guangping City

36:46.110 --> 36:48.030
to ashes right now!

36:48.880 --> 36:51.110
Let's all die together!

36:51.880 --> 36:53.360
Go to hell together!

37:27.000 --> 37:28.630
The Origin-returning Sword?

37:28.630 --> 37:30.290
The Origin-returning Sword!

37:52.490 --> 37:54.090
I've planned for a lifetime,

37:55.090 --> 37:56.930
giving it my everything.

37:58.190 --> 37:59.800
How could I fail?

38:27.620 --> 38:28.180
Banxia!

38:30.030 --> 38:30.490
Banxia.

38:31.440 --> 38:31.900
Banxia.

38:32.310 --> 38:33.310
How are you doing?

38:35.830 --> 38:37.630
This place is about to collapse.

38:39.110 --> 38:40.310
You should leave now.

38:41.290 --> 38:41.920
How could I possibly

38:41.920 --> 38:42.850
leave you behind

38:43.030 --> 38:44.230
and get out by myself?

38:48.540 --> 38:50.070
I have no strength to leave.

38:52.550 --> 38:53.590
Just go.

38:56.920 --> 38:57.510
Banxia.

39:45.960 --> 39:46.880
Xuanye,

39:49.000 --> 39:51.400
there's no time to waste. You need to go now.

40:37.230 --> 40:37.800
Banxia.

40:42.150 --> 40:42.800
Forget me.

41:03.560 --> 41:05.800
♫Wishing for a nice city♫

41:06.260 --> 41:09.520
♫To idle away♫

41:10.630 --> 41:16.510
♫Waiting for a light that won't go out♫

41:18.090 --> 41:20.770
♫Seeing the moon rise and set♫

41:21.220 --> 41:24.760
♫Condensing the past all into tears♫

41:25.190 --> 41:31.270
♫To reflect the passion glowing in my eyes♫

41:35.220 --> 41:42.270
♫Who forgot about the ups and downs of that long night's journey?♫

41:42.980 --> 41:49.350
♫Leaving behind a pouring rain of love and hatred♫

41:50.660 --> 41:57.850
♫Who remembers what's deeply engraved by fate?♫

41:58.560 --> 42:04.060
♫A fleeting memory, yet love endures♫

42:10.470 --> 42:13.750
♫The beginning of love♫

42:17.850 --> 42:20.490
♫The return is yet unknown♫

42:25.500 --> 42:28.620
♫Through endless days and nights♫

42:32.840 --> 42:35.600
♫Where my heart leads me to♫

42:33.150 --> 42:33.880
Banxia,

42:34.690 --> 42:37.640
may you live a life free of worries.

42:40.710 --> 42:47.490
♫Who is talking about never letting go of the memory♫

42:48.150 --> 42:54.380
♫Dreaming about the intertwined joy and sorrow♫

42:55.740 --> 43:02.990
♫Who knows the river of life winds through with twists and turns♫

43:03.860 --> 43:10.990
♫A fleeting memory, yet love endures♫
